 "remarks": "Live the SoNo Lifestyle - Private Entrance + Porch + Parking Charming meets modern in this beautifully laid-out 3 bedroom, 2 bath Victorian duplex with your own private entrance and front porch, a rare find in the heart of South Norwalk. Step into a welcoming foyer and head upstairs to a sun-filled main level featuring a bright living area, an updated kitchen, a full bath, and a spacious bedroom, all finished with classic hardwood floors. The upper level offers two additional bedrooms, a second full bath, and the convenience of an in unit washer/dryer. Generous closet space throughout makes everyday living easy. Reserved off street parking included. Location is everything just 1 block to the waterfront, moments to SoNo's best restaurants, bars, and shops, 2 blocks to Metro-North, and easy access to I-95 for a seamless commute. Available for qualified applicants with strong credit. 1-month security.",
